			<div class="content" id="post-content-3755507">
									

<p>This is something I've been meaning to write up for awhile. This week two people asked me about how to set up a collab sandbox, so I figured I'd put my experience of co-authoring 22 pages (SCPs, a GoI format, and a guide) to use and share some things I've learned.</p>
<p>Big, big thanks to Dexanote, Pedantique, shaggydredlocks, Decibelle, and fieldstone for looking over this in chat.</p>
<p>Special thanks to Galaxy-Class, who gave me a very thorough review in chat!</p>
<p>If anyone has any other questions about co-authoring or suggestions for additions to this page, feel free to ask them here.</p>

